# Data sources

Full reference: [docs/data-sources.md](../../docs/data-sources.md)

## Priority

| Need | Source | Write to |
|------|--------|----------|
| RU display names | HoYoWiki (`ru-ru`) | `characters.ts` / `weapons.ts` / `sets.ts` `.name` |
| L90 / A6 base stats (released) | Genshin Optimizer datamine | same |
| L90 stats (unreleased / missing in GO) | HoYoWiki entry «Возвысить» | same |
| Set rarity + 2pc | GO `artifact_set.json` + wiki set effects | `sets.ts` |
| Guide % tables | Prydwen → KQM / TCL | `guides.ts` |

## HoYoWiki (official)

- Characters: https://wiki.hoyolab.com/pc/genshin/aggregate/2 (`menu_id: "2"`)
- Weapons: https://wiki.hoyolab.com/pc/genshin/aggregate/4 (`menu_id: "4"`)
- Sets: https://wiki.hoyolab.com/pc/genshin/aggregate/5 (`menu_id: "5"`)
- List API: `POST https://sg-wiki-api.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/genshin/wapi/get_entry_page_list`
- Page API: `GET .../wapi/entry_page?entry_page_id=`
- Headers: `x-rpc-language: ru-ru`, `x-rpc-wiki_app: genshin`

Do **not** use fandom wiki for RU names. Filter out Manekin/Manekina.
